  "title": "Cheesy Bay Scallop Puff Pastry Shells",
  "description": "This cheesy bay scallops in puff pastry shells recipe includes half-and-half, wine, sherry, mushrooms, Parmesan, Dijon, shallots, and fresh tarragon.",
